Description  "Jedi Sage

Due to centuries of Force training, this wise old Master can fight on both extreme ends of the spectrum.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF

^5Force Powers:
- Push (1)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (3)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- BP-Free Jumps
- Aerial Force Regen
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- 50% less knockback given
- 10% more knockback taken
- 30% slower hacking
- 30% slower skill cooldown"